cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "x3d-perspective: taking the user's perspective on X3D scenes"
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill and Python package that predicts the 2D view an X3D browser renders from a
  Viewpoint, captures and compares it in X_ITE and X3DOM, and resolves viewer-relative
  instructions into X3D field changes, following the X3D 4.1 specification.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Polys
    given-names: Nicholas
version: 7.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/npolys/3D_perspective_skill"
license-url: "https://github.com/npolys/3D_perspective_skill/blob/main/LICENSE"
keywords:
  - X3D
  - Web3D
  - X_ITE
  - X3DOM
  - viewpoint
  - spatial reasoning
  - agent skill
